OL,3,GNEWSALand deal setback stalls
OL,4,A3,500-home scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landowner has failed to secure a deal
OL,7,Fto sell key plots of land needed to
OL,8,Fbuild 3,500 homes in a derelict corner
OL,9,Fof Norwich, it has emerged.
OL,11,FSerruys Property Company had been in
OL,12,Fnegotiations with Homes England over
OL,13,Fthe potential sale of the former May
OL,14,FGurney and Deal Ground sites on the
OL,15,Fedge of Norwich.
OL,17,FThe area forms a key part of a wider
OL,18,FNorwich City Council regeneration
OL,19,Fproject with Homes England, which
OL,20,Fbought the neighbouring former Colman's
OL,21,Fmustard factory site this year.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
